#: includes/class-skwirrel-wc-sync-admin-dashboard.php:1803
msgid ""
"Choose the WooCommerce state for each Skwirrel product status. The built-in "
"statuses (Draft, Available, Discontinued) are always shown; any extra "
"statuses your Skwirrel instance defines are discovered automatically during "
"a sync — or click \"Refresh statuses from Skwirrel\" to fetch them now. "
"\"Keep published\" leaves the product visible, \"Draft\" hides it, \"Trash\" "
"moves it to the trash, and \"Deprecated\" retires it gradually."
msgstr ""
"Choose the WooCommerce state for each Skwirrel product status. The built-in "
"statuses (Draft, Available, Discontinued) are always shown; any extra "
"statuses your Skwirrel instance defines are discovered automatically during "
"a sync — or click \"Refresh statuses from Skwirrel\" to fetch them now. "
"\"Keep published\" leaves the product visible, \"Draft\" hides it, \"Trash\" "
"moves it to the trash, and \"Deprecated\" retires it gradually."

