"longer maintain the same value in two systems."
msgstr ""
"Drive WooCommerce fields from a Skwirrel custom class feature, so you no "
"longer maintain the same value in two systems."

#: includes/class-skwirrel-wc-sync-admin-dashboard.php:1869
msgid "Stock quantity"
msgstr "Stock quantity"

#: includes/class-skwirrel-wc-sync-admin-dashboard.php:1870
msgid "e.g. 1234 or STOCK_QTY"
msgstr "e.g. 1234 or STOCK_QTY"

#: includes/class-skwirrel-wc-sync-admin-dashboard.php:1873
msgid "Must be a numeric feature."
msgstr "Must be a numeric feature."

#: includes/class-skwirrel-wc-sync-admin-dashboard.php:1873
msgid ""
"The ID or code of one product-level custom feature holding the stock "
"quantity. Text is accepted only if it contains nothing but a number; range, "
"logical and multi-value features are ignored. When a product has no usable "
"value, its current stock is left untouched — never set to 0 and never "
"switched to unmanaged. Trade-item level features are not used. Products "
"priced on request keep their own availability whatever this feature says. "
"Clearing this field turns the mapping off again, and the next "
"synchronisation then returns priced variations to unmanaged and in stock, "
"discarding the quantities it had been maintaining."
msgstr ""
"The ID or code of one product-level custom feature holding the stock "
"quantity. Text is accepted only if it contains nothing but a number; range, "
"logical and multi-value features are ignored. When a product has no usable "
"value, its current stock is left untouched — never set to 0 and never "
"switched to unmanaged. Trade-item level features are not used. Products "
"priced on request keep their own availability whatever this feature says. "
"Clearing this field turns the mapping off again, and the next synchronisation "
"then returns priced variations to unmanaged and in stock, discarding the "
"quantities it had been maintaining."

#: includes/class-skwirrel-wc-sync-admin-dashboard.php:1878
